_Lv4gsQPuja3I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuNS4y8h_yTv4-dKGIVnaRqHzkMJOEjuz5KL-BIk311rg&oe=699B05BA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\u9884\u544a\u7247\u5c01\u9762\u56fe\u7247.png", "id": "1378159819287337", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035322_1378159822620670_4442149295807103551_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZLs5R-AHO-MQ7kNvwGhesOP&_nc_oc=AdmYmPkVnaU-bNhJG4hbJ7cj3aLfCT4vAOXEKiWLfSjWXLWt2UVq7CvlwIJs3zGaS0M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuQTDTW21j-E5b2JyRUiXMBO022HmdiD9JcB5XsxdKs7g&oe=699B0D36"}, "display_name": "Party Crashers: Balloons", "keywords": [], "long_description": "If you are a social expert, you can interact with other users in real-time voice chat, send emoji bubbles, and make unexpected actions in the game lobby. But if you are a social novice, there is no need to worry at all, there are many unique ice-breaking mini-games in the game lobby. You can also experience different modes of the game with other players in the game room. It's a stress-free world where you can have fun with your friends!\n\nGame Mode:\n-Scruffle Mode: Pick up any item on the ground at will, smash mercilessly at your opponent, and win!\n-Handball Mode: Team up with your teammates to pass, shoot, and score! Smash your opponents and hinder their attacks!\n-Graffiti Mode: Use props with different functions, let your imagination run wild, and turn the surrounding walls into works of art that only belong to you!\n\n", "short_description": "Party Crashers: Balloons is a casual, party-type VR game. Become \"Balloons\" in a world full of fantasy, and enjoy the joy of socializing with players from all over the world. "}]}, "developer_name": "HXDF", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://vrpro.sitaitongxue.com/web2/outsource/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HXDF", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https:/